  "title": "The Keyboard Cursor Goes Missing",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "accessibility/inclusion",
  "premise": "A keyboard user wants to submit a short form, but invisible focus makes the current control unclear. A visible focus indicator and a reviewed logical order reveal each next target before activation.",
